      "worked": "Half-yearly compounding gives $r=0.04\\div2=0.02$ and $n=10\\times2=20$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}150\\,000&=PV\\left(1+\\frac{0.04}{2}\\right)^{10\\times2}\\\\PV&=\\frac{150\\,000}{(1+0.02)^{20}}\\end{align*}$$\n\nCorrect answer: D.",
